<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5686] Endless partition eviction during node shutdown</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5686</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Observed the following behavior on TC:&lt;br/&gt;
A node cannot stop because system threads are continuously trying to clean partitions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=702633&amp;amp;buildTypeId=Ignite20Tests_IgniteRdd&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=702633&amp;amp;buildTypeId=Ignite20Tests_IgniteRdd&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Attached is a thread dump from the test&lt;/p&gt;</description>
