                            <comment id="16078164" author="gvvinblade" created="Fri, 7 Jul 2017 14:30:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The stack trace shows that partition is reserved for scan query invocation, but seems that nobody closes the query&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
